  "details": "On Desktop mode, some VRChat update happened (possibly a month ago) where the Comma and Period key is now a permanent bind for looking/turning left and right.\n\nThe problem is I specifically use the Comma and Period key to strafe (or moving sideways) left and right.\n\nAs a left-handed user who uses the mouse with my left hand and the keyboard with my right hand, this makes maneuvering around VRChat worlds very difficult when the look/turn functions took over the Comma and Period key binds. I request these \"Look/Turn\" function from the keys removed.",
